  "title": "Henry Schein Orthodontics Expands Myofunctional Portfolio with Addition of Froggymouth®",
  "summary": "MELVILLE, N.Y., April 29, 2026 Henry Schein Orthodontics (HSO), the orthodontics business of Henry Schein, Inc. (Nasdaq: HSIC), today announced the availability of Froggymouth(r), a myofunctional device designed to support the management of orofacial dysfunctions. Manufactured by Biotech Dental Smilers, Froggymouth is now available through Henry Schein Dental in the United States, further strengthening HSO's commitment to delivering comprehensive, clinically supported solutions that he",
